<title>USA: Xecom sees Q4 EBITDA profit.</title>
<headline>Xecom sees Q4 EBITDA profit.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO MIRAGE, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xecom Corp said it will report its first profit before income tax, depreciation and allocation (EBITDA) in the fourth quarter and show a 25 percent rise in sales over third quarter.</p>
<p>The company also said its Select Switch Systems subsidiary grew revenues 155 percent in the fourth quarter compared with the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said its 1996 audited results will be available the first week in May.</p>
